                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per turn, before this Character or a friendly MORTAL character within 3″ makes an Activation Test, this character may administer stimulants. The target removes up to 2 STRESS and loses 1 VITALITY.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
