            <characteristic name="Action" typeId="f8c1-cda5-b6e1-42b7">Simple</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="cd99-8fcd-7fa2-bfed">Target another friendly MORTAL Character within 3” and make a POWER TEST (0). For each Success, heal 1 damage from the target character.</characteristic>
