                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">This character ignores STRESS penalties when making MIGHT tests. When making MELEE ATTACKS, it gains +1 MIGHT for each STRESS it has, up to a maximum bonus equal to its POWER.</characteristic>
