                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">When this Character is attacked, roll a D10. On a roll of 1, this Character EXPLODES. At any time, this Character may EXPLODE as a FREE ACTION. When this Character EXPLODES deal 3 [TRANSCENDENT] to all Characters within 4”. Characters affected by this may roll REFLEX and remove a [TRANSCENDENT] damage for each successful roll. If this Character EXPLODES, they are immediately killed.</characteristic>
