                    <characteristic name="Traits and range" typeId="5aca-a7b8-a2de-08fa">Advanced. Firearm. Ranged.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">High Caliber: Criticals rolled by this weapon cannot be blocked by a successful Reflex roll.
Sniper: Enemy Targets get no COVER bonus from attacks with this weapon. Cannot target anything within 4” of the firing character.
